# Godot 4
.godot/
/android/
*.translation

# export_presets.cfg is deliberately NOT ignored, though Godot's own template
# ignores it. It carries no credentials here — code signing is off and the
# remote-deploy block is stock — and it is the only record of what a shippable
# build actually excludes (tools/, assets/, docs/). Ignoring it would mean
# "there is an export preset" was a claim nobody else could check out.
# If signing is ever enabled, move the certificate path into a local override
# rather than committing it.

